WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.967 --> 00:00:02.201
-Guys, here's how this works.

00:00:02.201 --> 00:00:03.536
We're going to have a number
of mystery objects

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:04.771
brought out in front of us,

00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:06.705
and our job is to guess
what each one is.

00:00:06.705 --> 00:00:10.043
The catch is that we have
to figure out by touch alone.

00:00:10.043 --> 00:00:11.410
[ Laughter ]

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:13.513
Honestly, I -- really,
I said it's a fun game,

00:00:13.513 --> 00:00:15.014
but I really don't mean that.

00:00:15.014 --> 00:00:17.383
-Have there ever been actual
dangerous things in there?

00:00:17.383 --> 00:00:18.484
-Yeah.
-Okay. Okay.

00:00:18.484 --> 00:00:19.885
-There's been one
or two dangerous things.

00:00:19.885 --> 00:00:20.954
-Okay.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.954 --> 00:00:22.287
-Usually towards the end,
though, right?

00:00:22.287 --> 00:00:24.256
-Oh, great. Whatever.

00:00:24.256 --> 00:00:26.159
I'm down. I like to touch.

00:00:26.159 --> 00:00:27.526
-Since I'm the host,
I'm going to go first.

00:00:27.526 --> 00:00:28.728
-Okay.
-All right.

00:00:28.728 --> 00:00:30.163
Let's get our first object.
All right.

00:00:30.163 --> 00:00:31.697
And you can go in front,
if you want.

00:00:31.697 --> 00:00:32.899
And just --
-Okay.

00:00:32.899 --> 00:00:35.702
-I'll have 30 seconds
to identify what this is.

00:00:35.702 --> 00:00:39.839
[ Laughter ]

00:00:39.839 --> 00:00:40.873
Okay. Is it --

00:00:40.873 --> 00:00:42.642
-So there are scary ones,
apparently.

00:00:42.642 --> 00:00:43.710
Okay.

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:45.811
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.811 --> 00:00:47.847
-I'm going to freak out.
I'm freaking out.

00:00:47.847 --> 00:00:49.948
I swear to you, this is
not my game at all, man.

00:00:49.948 --> 00:00:52.051
I'm like -- [ Screaming ]

00:00:52.051 --> 00:00:54.254
Don't make noise. Is it
going to move or something?

00:00:54.254 --> 00:00:56.055
I swear --
-Come in through the side.

00:00:56.055 --> 00:00:57.623
-This is the last time
I'm playing this game ever.

00:00:57.623 --> 00:00:59.191
I just really don't
like this at all.

00:00:59.191 --> 00:01:00.626
Oh!
-You're fine!

00:01:00.626 --> 00:01:03.162
-Oh!
-Oh, my God.

00:01:03.162 --> 00:01:04.163
-Oh!

00:01:04.163 --> 00:01:05.965
♪♪

00:01:05.965 --> 00:01:07.533
-Butter?
Is it sticks of butter?

00:01:07.533 --> 00:01:09.368
[ Ding! ]
-Oh, my God!

00:01:09.368 --> 00:01:13.138
♪♪

00:01:13.138 --> 00:01:15.541
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:15.541 --> 00:01:18.144
-Get this out.
-It seems so easy.

00:01:18.144 --> 00:01:19.913
-Yeah? It seems so easy,
well, get ready,

00:01:19.913 --> 00:01:21.848
you're about to play this game.
Oh, man.

00:01:21.848 --> 00:01:24.616
Get ready.
Oh, you are good at that.

00:01:24.616 --> 00:01:26.052
All right, here we go.

00:01:26.052 --> 00:01:28.588
[ Audience groans ]

00:01:28.588 --> 00:01:30.723
-The reaction is the worst part.

00:01:30.723 --> 00:01:32.358
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.358 --> 00:01:34.394
I make fun of it.
I've been watching this game.

00:01:34.394 --> 00:01:37.797
-Ugh!

00:01:37.797 --> 00:01:39.232
Ew!
-Stop it.

00:01:39.232 --> 00:01:41.968
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.968 --> 00:01:43.570
-Ow!
-What was that?

00:01:43.570 --> 00:01:46.639
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.639 --> 00:01:49.074
Okay, I'm going this side.
-Okay, no!

00:01:49.074 --> 00:01:50.509
[ Screaming ]
-[ Screaming ] What is it?

00:01:50.509 --> 00:01:52.211
Jimmy!
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.211 --> 00:01:54.180
-Trust me, I won't --
seriously, I'm being serious.

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:55.481
-Oh.
-Do whatever you touch

00:01:55.481 --> 00:01:58.317
with that hand.
Yeah, that's it.

00:01:58.317 --> 00:01:59.819
Yep. Go right in.

00:01:59.819 --> 00:02:01.186
-No.

00:02:01.186 --> 00:02:03.689
-I promise you. Trust me.

00:02:03.689 --> 00:02:04.890
That hand. That hand.

00:02:04.890 --> 00:02:07.826
-I'm sweating now.
-Trust me. It's that hand.

00:02:07.826 --> 00:02:09.128
You've got it. You've got it.
That's it.

00:02:09.128 --> 00:02:11.097
Feel what that is.

00:02:11.097 --> 00:02:15.134
You can squish it
between your fingers.

00:02:15.134 --> 00:02:17.670
-No!
Oh, God, is it an ant farm?

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:20.306
[ Laughter ]

00:02:20.306 --> 00:02:21.907
[ Buzzer ]
[ Sad tuba plays ]

00:02:21.907 --> 00:02:24.610
-It's not an ant farm.
It was -- It's a sand castle.

00:02:24.610 --> 00:02:25.778
-Oh.
-Yeah.

00:02:25.778 --> 00:02:26.846
[ Laughter ]
-That's close.

00:02:26.846 --> 00:02:29.148
I mean, ant farm was close.

00:02:29.148 --> 00:02:30.583
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah.

00:02:30.583 --> 00:02:31.784
-Wow.
-Maybe we'll give you credit.

00:02:31.784 --> 00:02:32.885
I know, it's tough right?
-Wow.

00:02:32.885 --> 00:02:34.286
-It's a mental game, right?
-Holy cow.

00:02:34.286 --> 00:02:36.122
-All right, oh, no.
This one looks big.

00:02:36.122 --> 00:02:38.357
Why is this box bigger
than the other box?

00:02:38.357 --> 00:02:44.897
[ Audience oohs ]

00:02:44.897 --> 00:02:47.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:52.905 --> 00:02:57.143
[ Ominous music plays ]

00:02:57.143 --> 00:02:58.711
-You've got to go down.

00:02:58.711 --> 00:03:00.146
[ Laughter ]

00:03:00.146 --> 00:03:02.949
I mean, once you --
once you feel the top,

00:03:02.949 --> 00:03:06.052
you'll want to go down.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:06.052 --> 00:03:10.823
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:10.823 --> 00:03:16.362
♪♪

00:03:16.362 --> 00:03:21.901
♪♪

00:03:21.901 --> 00:03:23.836
I don't even know what it is.

00:03:23.836 --> 00:03:25.972
[ Laughter ]

00:03:25.972 --> 00:03:27.140
♪♪

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:30.876
Oh, my gosh.

00:03:30.876 --> 00:03:32.011
You've got this.
You got it!

00:03:32.011 --> 00:03:34.079
No! [ Screaming ]
-[ Screaming ]

00:03:34.079 --> 00:03:36.015
[ Laughter ]
-Is it -- did it lick me?

00:03:36.015 --> 00:03:37.749
[ Laughter ]

00:03:37.749 --> 00:03:41.387
There's wetness. There's wetness
on my finger right now.

00:03:41.387 --> 00:03:45.024
Something liquidy is in there.

00:03:45.024 --> 00:03:45.825
-Yeah.

00:03:45.825 --> 00:03:48.294
-Oh, it's liquid. It's warm.

00:03:48.294 --> 00:03:50.930
It's going to be an amphibian.
It's going to be a frog.

00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:52.898
A frog.

00:03:52.898 --> 00:03:54.500
-I'm looking at it,
and I have no idea what it is.

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:55.868
[ Buzzer ]

00:03:55.868 --> 00:03:57.303
-Should I just try to touch it
one more time?

00:03:57.303 --> 00:03:59.839
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:59.839 --> 00:04:02.140
♪♪

00:04:02.140 --> 00:04:04.210
-It appears to be docile.

00:04:04.210 --> 00:04:07.647
♪♪

00:04:07.647 --> 00:04:10.649
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:10.649 --> 00:04:12.685
-[ Screaming ]

00:04:12.685 --> 00:04:15.320
Ew! Ew! Gross!

00:04:15.320 --> 00:04:17.456
Disgusting! Ew!

00:04:17.456 --> 00:04:19.324
Was it an eel or a snake
or something?

00:04:19.324 --> 00:04:20.793
An eel? What is that?

00:04:20.793 --> 00:04:22.628
-I don't know what it is.
[ Buzzer ]

00:04:22.628 --> 00:04:23.629
-What is that? Ew!

00:04:23.629 --> 00:04:24.897
[ Laughter ]

00:04:24.897 --> 00:04:27.332
Are you joking me?

00:04:27.332 --> 00:04:31.203
That is not in the rules at all
or any respect for me at all.

00:04:31.203 --> 00:04:34.006
What in the hell is that?
-I have no idea.

00:04:34.006 --> 00:04:36.008
-What is that?

00:04:36.008 --> 00:04:38.077
-It's a lung fish.
-Lung fish?

00:04:38.077 --> 00:04:39.645
What is a lung fish?
-I don't know.

00:04:39.645 --> 00:04:41.713
-Oh, my God.
Is it like a catfish?

00:04:41.713 --> 00:04:43.182
-He's a sleepy lung fish.

00:04:43.182 --> 00:04:43.949
[ Audience awws ]

00:04:43.949 --> 00:04:45.852
I want to touch him.

00:04:45.852 --> 00:04:47.519
Aw, guys.

00:04:47.519 --> 00:04:49.288
I want to cook it.
-All right -- Oh, my God.

00:04:49.288 --> 00:04:51.691
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:55.895 --> 00:04:58.363
No cooking any of our animals.
-That's where my mind goes.

00:04:58.363 --> 00:05:01.167
-All right, you are up now.
Here you go. Good luck.

00:05:01.167 --> 00:05:02.902
It's fun.
It's going to be fine.

00:05:02.902 --> 00:05:04.937
[ Audience groans ]

00:05:04.937 --> 00:05:06.505
You want a hint?
-I mean, yes.

00:05:06.505 --> 00:05:09.041
-Have you seen "Jurassic Park"?
-Oh, my gosh!

00:05:09.041 --> 00:05:12.078
[ Laughter ]

00:05:12.078 --> 00:05:14.046
Is it Bryce Dallas Howard?
[ Laughter ]

00:05:14.046 --> 00:05:16.749
-I wish.

00:05:16.749 --> 00:05:18.350
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:18.350 --> 00:05:20.353
-You guys.

00:05:20.353 --> 00:05:22.421
[ Ominous music plays ]

00:05:22.421 --> 00:05:26.158
-Dude, just --
This is legendary, dude.

00:05:26.158 --> 00:05:29.929
That's all I'm saying.

00:05:29.929 --> 00:05:31.531
-[ Screaming ]

00:05:31.531 --> 00:05:34.300
[ Laughter ]

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:36.802
♪♪

00:05:36.802 --> 00:05:38.905
What happened? What happened?
What happened?

00:05:38.905 --> 00:05:40.706
-It bit me.
-Oh, my gosh.

00:05:40.706 --> 00:05:42.208
Well, it bit you.
We can give this one away.

00:05:42.208 --> 00:05:44.043
It is a toy.

00:05:44.043 --> 00:05:47.313
It's a toy dinosaur.

00:05:47.313 --> 00:05:50.283
[ Sad tuba plays ]

00:05:50.283 --> 00:05:51.450
[ Applause ]

00:05:51.450 --> 00:05:53.319
It didn't really bite you.

00:05:53.319 --> 00:05:55.287
Send whoever's in here away.

00:05:55.287 --> 00:05:56.856
-I'm sorry.
-Was that frightening?

00:05:56.856 --> 00:05:59.091
-I thought it could have
been John for a second.

00:05:59.091 --> 00:06:00.859
-Oh, my gosh.
-I know.

00:06:00.859 --> 00:06:03.396
Oh, my gosh. Oh, my gosh.

00:06:03.396 --> 00:06:05.163
This is real.
-This is real, right?

00:06:05.163 --> 00:06:06.532
-People don't get it.

00:06:06.532 --> 00:06:09.001
[ Audience ohhs ]

00:06:14.239 --> 00:06:15.475
-Wait! Wait!
-I'm out.

00:06:15.475 --> 00:06:17.110
-We're supposed to do
this together.

00:06:17.110 --> 00:06:18.644
-No, man.

00:06:18.644 --> 00:06:21.080
No! No.

00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:24.550
-This is --
-No.

00:06:24.550 --> 00:06:26.752
This is my --
-What are you talking about?

00:06:26.752 --> 00:06:28.787
This last one we're supposed
to one-hand in together.

00:06:28.787 --> 00:06:30.422
-No!

00:06:30.422 --> 00:06:34.126
-Well, now you've seen it!
-I saw it. I'm 1,000% not.

00:06:34.126 --> 00:06:37.263
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:37.263 --> 00:06:42.201
♪♪

00:06:42.201 --> 00:06:44.670
This is might be the worst one
I've ever seen on here!

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:46.305
-Stop it right now.
-That's all I want to say.

00:06:46.305 --> 00:06:48.040
[ Laughs ]

00:06:48.040 --> 00:06:49.442
-[ Screaming ]

00:06:49.442 --> 00:06:52.311
[ Laughter ]

00:06:52.311 --> 00:06:54.313
-Too mad, so sad, everything --

00:06:54.313 --> 00:06:57.283
-Okay.

00:06:57.283 --> 00:06:59.719
[ Laughter ]

00:06:59.719 --> 00:07:02.988
You guys...

00:07:02.988 --> 00:07:05.591
[ Audience cheering ]

00:07:05.591 --> 00:07:07.125
-I have no idea what it is
at all.

00:07:07.125 --> 00:07:08.127
But I did touch it right?

00:07:08.127 --> 00:07:09.528
[ Buzzer ]
-That was good though.

00:07:09.528 --> 00:07:11.697
-I'll guess. Is it a snake
or something like that?

00:07:11.697 --> 00:07:15.134
Or -- is it a lizard?
-No.

00:07:15.134 --> 00:07:19.572
-Oh, is it a frog?
-No.

00:07:19.572 --> 00:07:21.240
Ew!
[ Sad tuba plays ]

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:23.575
[ Laughter ]
Are you out of your mind?!

00:07:23.575 --> 00:07:25.677
What in the -- what?

00:07:25.677 --> 00:07:27.446
Is that cockroaches?!

00:07:27.446 --> 00:07:30.182
-Yeah.
-Are you out of your mind?!

00:07:30.182 --> 00:07:32.218
-Like I --
-Oh, my gosh!

00:07:32.218 --> 00:07:35.221
-I'll touch anything, but...
-Oh, my gosh!

00:07:35.221 --> 00:07:39.091
♪♪

00:07:39.091 --> 00:07:42.228
-My thanks to Chrissy Teigen.
[ Cheers and applause ]

